xternal-link arrow (the GitHub mark is a Brands glyph, not in Solid). IconFontTests moved to Agg.UI and check every named constant is in the font's cmap and renders ink; the FontSelector fallback test names a face string FA 6 cannot draw, since FA 6 maps A-Z, a-z and digits to letter icons.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"BasedHardware/omi","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:09:00Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"04dbc9e61884d15bd82eace385b883880448c8e8","github_link":"https://github.com/BasedHardware/omi/commit/04dbc9e61884d15bd82eace385b883880448c8e8","commit_subject":"fix(backend): bind audio replay and speaker reads to committed objects","ai_tool":"Devin"},{"repo_name":"huggingface/transformers","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:08:52Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"469230357aab0f2b303b0d638c1f8d06edb14184","github_link":"https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/commit/469230357aab0f2b303b0d638c1f8d06edb14184","commit_subject":"[CI] Avoid fetching all artifacts when only specific ones are needed (#49282)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ubolonton/emacs-module-rs","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:08:41Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"e55051ab549b7192a7577e2729ad62de1d096ffd","github_link":"https://github.com/ubolonton/emacs-module-rs/commit/e55051ab549b7192a7577e2729ad62de1d096ffd","commit_subject":"feat(error)!: Classify vector index errors","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"expertanalytics/rasputin","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:08:30Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"1edb48b3c8d70982d0bcd0c40b8865158093f3cd","github_link":"https://github.com/expertanalytics/rasputin/commit/1edb48b3c8d70982d0bcd0c40b8865158093f3cd","commit_subject":"Increment 24: @perf acceptance, ACCEPTED (paired form, AC)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"jdereg/java-util","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:07:46Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"87d8cd01d8fe6f8a43470d4a54a5f14d58f1c533","github_link":"https://github.com/jdereg/java-util/commit/87d8cd01d8fe6f8a43470d4a54a5f14d58f